WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
Safex

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:05.897
When Candy came back
from Franny's house,

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:09.403
a man was brought to the hospital.

00:00:10.003 --> 00:00:12.302
Candy was shocked.

00:00:12.546 --> 00:00:16.641
This patient, who just got back
from the European battlefields,

00:00:16.791 --> 00:00:19.583
looked just like Mr. Albert.

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:27.784
The man who forgot his past.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.122
Mr. Albert!

00:00:30.272 --> 00:00:33.064
Wait!

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:39.531
Don't come near!

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.567
He wouldn't stay still.

00:00:41.717 --> 00:00:43.610
So we gave him a tranquilizer.

00:00:43.944 --> 00:00:47.345
Take care of this animal.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:54.784
Poope, be good
or you are going to get kicked out.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:00.954
You are so skinny
and you are losing your fur.

00:01:05.199 --> 00:01:06.593
Doctor Leonard,

00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:08.962
which ward is this patient going?

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.864
Ward No. 0.

00:01:12.014 --> 00:01:14.066
Ward No. 0?

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:21.275
Ward No. 0 has no sunlight,
and it is small and dirty.

00:01:22.716 --> 00:01:24.142
As expected.

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:29.014
Ward No. 0 is for criminals
and dying people.

00:01:29.264 --> 00:01:31.749
He just wouldn't wake up.

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:37.022
That man is Mr. Albert, for sure!

00:01:37.331 --> 00:01:39.958
Mr. Albert will not stay
in ward No. 0!

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:42.324
Doctor Leonard!

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:48.200
I know that patient,
his name is Mr. Albert.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:50.269
You know that patient?

00:01:50.519 --> 00:01:52.776
Yes, he is my friend.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.177
Don't send him to ward No. 0!

00:01:55.349 --> 00:01:57.476
I didn't know he was your friend.

00:01:57.626 --> 00:01:59.678
Albert, you say?

00:02:00.621 --> 00:02:02.314
What is his surname?

00:02:02.464 --> 00:02:04.016
- Surname?
- His address?

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:06.887
- Address...
- His family?

00:02:08.562 --> 00:02:10.530
Why?

00:02:10.831 --> 00:02:12.230
What is his surname?

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:14.198
His age?

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:18.127
I don't know. I just know his name.

00:02:20.207 --> 00:02:23.108
Although we know each other
for quite a long time,

00:02:24.111 --> 00:02:26.671
we didn't get to know each other
very well...

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:31.410
I can ask Mr. Albert
for his address and family...

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:34.147
Enough, Candice! You can go.

00:02:34.388 --> 00:02:37.621
That man has lost his memory.

00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:39.592
He lost his memory?

00:02:40.861 --> 00:02:44.456
Mr. Albert forgot everything
about the past?

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:46.458
He's unidentified.

00:02:46.608 --> 00:02:49.366
There's no one to pay
for his hospital bills.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:52.494
He doesn't seem to be seriously hurt.

00:02:52.973 --> 00:02:54.497
Ward No. 0 will be fine.

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:59.943
I am doing the best I can, Candice.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.478
Candy!

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.078
Stay out of this.

00:03:07.228 --> 00:03:08.446
Yeah.

00:03:08.596 --> 00:03:11.781
Having a student
who knows a criminal,

00:03:11.931 --> 00:03:13.151
is a shame for
The Merry Jane Nurse School.

00:03:13.301 --> 00:03:15.717
Mr. Albert is not a criminal!

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:19.124
He didn't lose his memory either.
It's a lie!

00:03:19.274 --> 00:03:20.860
We will see when he wakes up.

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.634
He will be fine
when he sees me and Poope.

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:29.305
Poope, would Mr. Albert
ever forget about you?

00:03:31.011 --> 00:03:36.472
He liked you so much, how would he...

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.482
This is a nightmare!

00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:42.717
The Mr. Albert I knew...

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:44.723
Mr. Albert...

00:04:42.114 --> 00:04:44.605
Poope, stay in my room.

00:04:44.817 --> 00:04:47.149
Have a good rest, ok?

00:04:49.655 --> 00:04:51.520
Be good.

00:04:55.061 --> 00:04:56.053
Candy,

00:04:56.203 --> 00:05:00.058
that patient came from Italy.

00:05:00.508 --> 00:05:01.566
From Italy?

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:04.761
I heard he was injured
when his train was bombed.

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:12.608
He was trying to protect that skunk.

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:17.645
He tried to protect Poope...

00:05:18.251 --> 00:05:21.712
That explains why
that skunk wouldn't leave him.

00:05:21.862 --> 00:05:25.082
Candy, stay out of this.

00:05:25.232 --> 00:05:29.753
I heard that
there was a spy on the train.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.826
He claimed that he lost his memory.

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:36.761
He must be a spy.

00:05:36.911 --> 00:05:38.596
He just happened to be
on the same train.

00:05:38.746 --> 00:05:42.233
And you think of Mr. Albert as a spy!

00:05:42.383 --> 00:05:44.902
He is not that type of person!

00:05:52.485 --> 00:05:56.313
How unlucky to have someone
like him in this hospital!

00:05:56.763 --> 00:06:00.415
He has been murmuring words like
America and Chicago unconsciously.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.284
Unconsciously...

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.590
The wounded shouldn't be sent here.

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:10.123
It is not easy for those
hospitals in Italy, but still...

00:06:10.936 --> 00:06:14.633
They couldn't do anything for him.

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:17.275
That's why he is here?

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:22.110
He has been murmuring words
such as America and Chicago.

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:28.082
The whole hospital
is talking about Mr. Albert.

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:31.753
But he is not welcomed here.

00:06:32.791 --> 00:06:34.051
Mr. Albert,

00:06:34.201 --> 00:06:36.253
why were you in Italy?

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:38.792
Weren't you in Africa?

00:06:39.631 --> 00:06:42.526
You had a small clinic there...

00:06:42.676 --> 00:06:45.570
And you were taking care of animals.

00:06:46.505 --> 00:06:48.405
You were always so bright,

00:06:49.074 --> 00:06:50.868
so full of energy...

00:06:51.018 --> 00:06:53.309
Travelling all over the world,

00:06:54.179 --> 00:06:56.943
free like the wind.

00:07:03.055 --> 00:07:04.488
Poope!

00:07:06.158 --> 00:07:08.449
Weren't you supposed to be in my room?

00:07:09.228 --> 00:07:11.488
You are going to get into troubles
if you keep wandering around.

00:07:11.638 --> 00:07:14.460
Poope, do you want to see Mr. Albert?

00:07:17.236 --> 00:07:19.227
Actually, me too.

00:07:22.307 --> 00:07:23.899
It smells musty!

00:07:27.813 --> 00:07:29.644
Mr. Albert...

00:07:32.584 --> 00:07:34.313
You became thinner.

00:07:34.853 --> 00:07:37.686
He looks so handsome
without the sunglasses!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.182
Mr. Albert, please wake up!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:45.494
I don't want a reunion
with you not recognizing me!

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:48.993
Poope, don't worry.

00:07:49.643 --> 00:07:53.967
I will stay by your side
I will protect you.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.218
Mr. Albert...

00:08:06.785 --> 00:08:08.946
Are you up?

00:08:10.622 --> 00:08:14.080
I hope you can regain consciousness.

00:08:19.198 --> 00:08:21.662
Is the doctor going to help him?

00:08:22.801 --> 00:08:26.396
We just can't leave him like that
in that room.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:41.712
It hurts!

00:08:41.862 --> 00:08:44.449
Help me, nurse!

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:47.255
Stear!

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:50.520
What is wrong?

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.859
Nurse...

00:08:53.031 --> 00:08:54.965
My leg...

00:08:55.934 --> 00:08:57.731
Archie!

00:08:57.969 --> 00:08:59.396
My arm...

00:08:59.746 --> 00:09:01.198
Annie!

00:09:01.348 --> 00:09:03.500
What happened to you all?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:08.112
How are we going to see you
if we don't pretend to be patients?

00:09:09.681 --> 00:09:12.609
Your bandages look bad.

00:09:13.385 --> 00:09:15.785
Brother said this is good.

00:09:15.987 --> 00:09:17.852
Yeah, we look just like the wounded.

00:09:19.424 --> 00:09:21.918
Stear, Archie and Annie...

00:09:22.068 --> 00:09:25.588
Why do they show up at such time?

00:09:29.701 --> 00:09:32.397
Be careful!

00:09:33.738 --> 00:09:35.933
Come with me.

00:09:37.242 --> 00:09:39.970
What a helpful young nurse!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.706
We're so grateful!

00:09:42.547 --> 00:09:44.178
Keep quiet!

00:09:50.054 --> 00:09:51.681
Welcome!

00:09:51.831 --> 00:09:54.486
Candy, did you meet Terry?

00:09:55.026 --> 00:09:57.426
Yes, just for a short moment.

00:09:58.196 --> 00:10:01.757
Terry left with the train.

00:10:02.433 --> 00:10:05.368
The wind connects us together.

00:10:09.741 --> 00:10:11.538
Great, Candy!

00:10:12.677 --> 00:10:16.239
Why do you seem lifeless
even though you have seen Terry?

00:10:16.389 --> 00:10:17.841
Why, Candy?

00:10:17.991 --> 00:10:20.476
You look upset.

00:10:20.818 --> 00:10:22.479
Let's go to the yard.

00:10:22.687 --> 00:10:25.914
Right. I wanted to go to the yard.

00:10:26.624 --> 00:10:29.353
I have something to show you.

00:10:29.703 --> 00:10:31.088
Me?

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.258
What is it?

00:10:43.541 --> 00:10:46.733
Come, Candy!

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.082
Patty!

00:11:02.293 --> 00:11:03.851
Candy!

00:11:10.401 --> 00:11:11.561
Patty!

00:11:11.711 --> 00:11:13.263
Candy!

00:11:19.377 --> 00:11:20.738
Patty!

00:11:22.714 --> 00:11:24.113
Candy!

00:11:29.954 --> 00:11:30.980
Patty!

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:32.282
Candy!

00:11:32.432 --> 00:11:34.751
I missed you, Candy!

00:11:34.901 --> 00:11:39.263
I missed you too!
It has been so long, Patty!

00:11:39.864 --> 00:11:41.661
Candy!

00:11:50.775 --> 00:11:54.337
I came to Chicago last night
and I couldn't wait to see you.

00:11:54.687 --> 00:11:57.911
She wanted to see you so desperately,
she has been bothering me about that.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:01.651
Now we meet, Patty.

00:12:01.861 --> 00:12:04.481
It has been ages
since we separated in London.

00:12:04.831 --> 00:12:06.690
Candy...

00:12:08.059 --> 00:12:10.960
You look very nice in this dress.

00:12:12.130 --> 00:12:13.556
Thank you.

00:12:14.006 --> 00:12:16.559
But it seems
you have put on some weight.

00:12:16.709 --> 00:12:18.393
Come on, Patty!

00:12:19.203 --> 00:12:21.433
If we take a closer look...

00:12:23.141 --> 00:12:24.733
Cut it out, Stear!

00:12:28.913 --> 00:12:30.106
This is a hospital.

00:12:30.256 --> 00:12:32.257
Aren't you guys patients?

00:12:35.453 --> 00:12:36.886
Yeah.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:44.753
America is so peaceful.

00:12:45.496 --> 00:12:47.862
There is no war here.

00:12:48.599 --> 00:12:50.694
It must be pretty bad in London.

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:56.465
More and more women go on the front line
as medical personnel.

00:12:56.615 --> 00:12:58.571
Women go to the front line?

00:12:59.844 --> 00:13:02.904
They volunteer.

00:13:03.514 --> 00:13:09.578
It's men who should go to war
and protect their family.

00:13:09.987 --> 00:13:13.946
Entire families fighting on the field...

00:13:14.158 --> 00:13:16.996
How can we stand aside and watch?

00:13:17.336 --> 00:13:18.454
Brother!

00:13:18.604 --> 00:13:21.765
You look like
you can't wait to go to war.

00:13:25.169 --> 00:13:27.895
Patty, has St. Paul Academy
changed at all?

00:13:28.006 --> 00:13:31.033
Not very much.

00:13:31.183 --> 00:13:34.202
Principal Gray is just as strict
as she always was.

00:13:36.847 --> 00:13:38.774
The St. Paul Academy...

00:13:41.251 --> 00:13:43.617
The other Pony Hill...

00:13:45.155 --> 00:13:49.057
London City, the wide streets...

00:13:49.326 --> 00:13:51.191
The ongoing carriages...

00:13:52.496 --> 00:13:55.659
These will change because of war.

00:13:58.802 --> 00:14:03.535
I ran away from the Academy
during the May Festival,

00:14:04.608 --> 00:14:09.068
to go to the Blue River zoo
and meet up with Mr. Albert.

00:14:38.842 --> 00:14:42.337
Yeah, Candy, Yuli is here as well.

00:14:42.487 --> 00:14:44.139
I brought her out from the zoo.

00:14:44.289 --> 00:14:46.239
Next time I will bring her...

00:14:47.217 --> 00:14:48.707
Yuli...

00:14:48.952 --> 00:14:51.643
I handed her over to Mr. Albert.

00:14:51.793 --> 00:14:55.451
Mr. Albert was very happy.

00:14:59.496 --> 00:15:01.790
Candy, what is wrong?

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:03.856
Mr. Albert...

00:15:07.137 --> 00:15:09.365
What happened to Mr. Albert?

00:15:10.015 --> 00:15:13.168
Mr. Albert is in this hospital.

00:15:13.318 --> 00:15:14.603
Is it true, Candy?

00:15:14.753 --> 00:15:17.606
Is he injured? Or sick?

00:15:17.756 --> 00:15:19.608
He is not just injured...

00:15:19.758 --> 00:15:22.773
Mr. Albert has changed.

00:15:22.923 --> 00:15:26.582
He lost his memory!

00:15:28.458 --> 00:15:29.952
How could this happen?

00:15:30.102 --> 00:15:33.188
He was sent here
from a hospital in Italy.

00:15:33.338 --> 00:15:36.323
He is not welcomed here.

00:15:48.712 --> 00:15:51.010
Quiet!

00:15:58.221 --> 00:16:00.682
No, he hasn't regained consciousness.

00:16:00.832 --> 00:16:02.987
Let me see him Candy.

00:16:04.227 --> 00:16:06.955
It is better not to see him
until he regains consciousness.

00:16:07.105 --> 00:16:09.024
It would just make you feel bad.

00:16:09.174 --> 00:16:12.394
It would be worse if I'd leave
without seeing him.

00:16:12.544 --> 00:16:13.836
Please Candy.

00:16:18.174 --> 00:16:20.602
He is Mr. Albert's beloved Poope.

00:16:21.845 --> 00:16:25.281
It smells musty! What a lousy room!

00:16:26.549 --> 00:16:28.346
Is he Mr. Albert?

00:16:28.551 --> 00:16:30.485
He's very weak,
but I'm sure it's him.

00:16:32.822 --> 00:16:34.756
Is he really Mr. Albert?

00:16:35.358 --> 00:16:37.218
He is so handsome!

00:16:37.368 --> 00:16:40.755
Why was he wearing sun glasses all day?

00:16:40.905 --> 00:16:43.024
Brother, cut it out!

00:16:45.568 --> 00:16:47.058
Brother.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:49.030
Unforgivable!

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:50.732
Such a kind man...

00:16:50.882 --> 00:16:52.638
Because of the war...

00:17:00.817 --> 00:17:03.660
Just tell us
if there is anything we can do.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:05.447
Please do, Candy.

00:17:05.988 --> 00:17:07.582
Thank you.

00:17:07.732 --> 00:17:09.184
I will tell you guys if I need help.

00:17:09.334 --> 00:17:11.459
We will be back, Candy.

00:17:11.861 --> 00:17:14.295
Take care of Mr. Albert.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.154
Good bye, Candy.

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:21.131
Good bye!

00:17:22.939 --> 00:17:27.740
Right, I have to take care of Mr. Albert.

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:30.774
I will swap shifts
with the nurse in charge.

00:17:36.052 --> 00:17:38.613
New bed sheets and a blanket.

00:17:38.763 --> 00:17:40.383
New clothes.

00:17:40.923 --> 00:17:42.416
Fruits and juice.

00:17:42.566 --> 00:17:45.289
I am sure this would help Mr. Albert.

00:17:53.903 --> 00:17:54.892
Mr. Albert...

00:18:02.445 --> 00:18:04.037
Mr. Albert!

00:18:05.915 --> 00:18:08.179
You are...

00:18:10.853 --> 00:18:13.181
He lost his memory indeed.

00:18:13.331 --> 00:18:15.884
He doesn't even know I am Candy.

00:18:19.295 --> 00:18:21.320
Mr. Albert...

00:18:24.967 --> 00:18:28.835
Sorry, Poope, you must be hungry too.

00:18:29.805 --> 00:18:32.733
Mr. Albert, you should eat something too.

00:18:32.883 --> 00:18:35.870
Please stay in bed.
You just regained consciousness.

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:37.310
Where is this place...

00:18:38.146 --> 00:18:39.438
America.

00:18:40.015 --> 00:18:42.609
Chicago, St. Joanna Hospital.

00:18:43.919 --> 00:18:47.780
I see, I was sent back to America.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:50.221
Chicago.

00:18:50.593 --> 00:18:51.958
America.

00:18:53.529 --> 00:18:55.520
Chicago, America.

00:18:57.132 --> 00:18:58.259
Mr. Albert!

00:18:58.409 --> 00:19:00.961
Don't force yourself
to remember things.

00:19:01.111 --> 00:19:03.903
Lie down and rest.

00:19:05.241 --> 00:19:06.970
Who is Mr. Albert?

00:19:07.643 --> 00:19:10.203
Why did you call me like that?

00:19:11.247 --> 00:19:12.973
Mr. Albert.

00:19:13.123 --> 00:19:15.442
If I tell you now
that we knew each other,

00:19:15.592 --> 00:19:19.783
it will just going to make you
even more confused.

00:19:21.156 --> 00:19:24.089
Who is Mr. Albert?

00:19:25.327 --> 00:19:29.623
I am sorry,
Albert is my brother's name.

00:19:30.132 --> 00:19:32.960
You look just like my brother.

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:38.029
And it's quite hard to call you
without a name.

00:19:38.841 --> 00:19:40.468
You don't like it?

00:19:41.643 --> 00:19:44.271
That's alright,
It's your brother's name.

00:19:46.114 --> 00:19:48.742
But, my name...

00:19:49.785 --> 00:19:51.412
My name...

00:19:52.321 --> 00:19:55.051
It's no use, I can't remember!

00:19:56.124 --> 00:19:57.718
Don't force yourself.

00:19:57.868 --> 00:20:00.421
You will start to remember
when you recover.

00:20:00.896 --> 00:20:03.456
And you will remember your name.

00:20:05.734 --> 00:20:09.963
Trust me, I'm a well-known nurse
in this hospital.

00:20:10.213 --> 00:20:11.321
You?

00:20:11.731 --> 00:20:15.269
Yes. Don't worry,
I will take care of you.

00:20:15.419 --> 00:20:17.471
I will keep you company.

00:20:18.046 --> 00:20:19.313
Your name is...

00:20:19.848 --> 00:20:22.676
I'm sorry! I am Candice White.

00:20:22.826 --> 00:20:24.645
Just call me Candy.

00:20:24.795 --> 00:20:26.311
Miss Candice.

00:20:26.989 --> 00:20:28.689
Candy is fine.

00:20:29.491 --> 00:20:31.322
Candy.

00:20:32.694 --> 00:20:33.786
Yes!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:36.790
Right, just Candy.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.857
This is how
Mr. Albert always called me.

00:20:43.138 --> 00:20:46.433
This is Poope.

00:20:46.583 --> 00:20:47.998
Poope.

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:50.908
I guess you want a name, Poope.

00:20:53.315 --> 00:20:55.283
Poope.

00:20:55.651 --> 00:20:57.346
Nice name.

00:20:59.554 --> 00:21:01.148
I must wait.

00:21:01.298 --> 00:21:04.284
I wish Mr. Albert
can remember everything.

00:21:04.434 --> 00:21:07.260
I will take good care of him
until then.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:11.397
Candy made her decision
deep inside her heart.
